                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.5914/83b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Danish Minister
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Treaty transmitted by President to Senate today with a request that the details
                    be kept secret.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank L. Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
